  "description": "# Conversation Summary\n\n1. **Initial Request:** User requested that ChatSidebar component maintain a fixed header and footer with a scrollable center section.\n\n2. **Layout Structure:** Header displays project details and root chat node, footer shows chat actions (logs, timeline, export, settings), and center contains scrollable content (attachments, profiles, subtasks).\n\n3. **Technical Implementation:** Used flexbox with `shrink-0` for header/footer and `flex-1 overflow-y-auto min-h-0` for scrollable center to enable proper overflow behavior.\n\n4. **Component Organization:** Reorganized ChatSidebar.vue with three distinct sections, each with appropriate styling, borders, and spacing to maintain visual hierarchy.\n\n5. **Result:** Delivered a complete, production-ready ChatSidebar component that keeps project context visible while allowing users to scroll through chat subtasks and profiles without losing access to quick action buttons.",
